# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets parses `_redirects` and is LINE-ENDING
# SENSITIVE: a CRLF copy is ignored silently - every rule stops applying and
# nothing anywhere reports an error. The site would just quietly 404 where it
# used to redirect. Pin it to LF so no checkout, editor or autocrlf setting
# can ever convert it.
#
# Verified 2026-11-09: /index.html returned 301 (not the platform's 307) only
# because the rules were parsed, which is the proof this file is being read.
_redirects text eol=lf

# Everything else keeps git's default behaviour.
